    Bug 2049258 - Fix intermittent comm/mail/test/browser/folder-display/browser_mailTelemetry.js | test_secure_mails_read - whould have one event for S/MIME signed=false encrypted=true - 2 == 1. r=kaie


    Turns out there was some intermittance.
    I changed S/MIME processing call signatureProcessingStarted() before verifying signature, so we can know what to expect.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D308111

diff --git a/mail/base/content/msgHdrView.js b/mail/base/content/msgHdrView.js
